Package: GSABenchmark
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Benchmarking Gene Set Analysis Methods
Version: 0.1.5
Author: Andrei-Florian Stoica
Maintainer: Andrei-Florian Stoica <andrei@gibh.ac.cn>
Description: GSABenchmark is a package designed for benchmarking scRNA-seq gene 
    set analysis methods. It provides both traditional and novel benchmark 
    metrics, as well as visualization tools. Currently, GSABenchmark supports 
    15 gene set analysis methods. 
